OL,3,AWhat is happening to UK prices?
OL,4,
OL,5,FInflation in the UK rose to 3.5% in the
OL,6,Fyear to September, the highest rate in
OL,7,Fnearly a year and above the Bank of
OL,8,FEngland's 2% target.
OL,10,FThe rise was slightly higher than
OL,11,Feconomists had predicted, driven by
OL,12,Fhigher petrol and diesel prices.
OL,14,FInflation is widely expected to rise
OL,15,Fagain in the coming months.
OL,17,FInflation is the increase in the price
OL,18,Fof something over time.
